    "inputs": {
      "text": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is a vibrant, modern 3D render of the text \"MINIMAX H3 SINGULARITY\" with glowing neon circuitry, digital waveforms, and a deep purple cosmic backdrop \u2014 used as a stylized title card. <Picture 1> is a high-contrast, cinematic tech-logo graphic.\n\n<Subject 2> is Jinx, a young woman with electric blue pigtails, pink eyes, cloud-pattern tattoos across her arms and legs, wearing a pink halter top, brown corset, plaid mini-skirt, black arm guards, and combat boots. <Picture 2> is a full character sheet displaying multiple angles and expressions.\n\n<Subject 3> is Tifa Lockhart, a fit young woman with long straight black hair, red eyes, wearing a white ribbed crop top, black utility skirt with straps, black leggings, red combat boots, and red fingerless gloves. <Picture 3> is a full character sheet displaying multiple angles and expressions.\n\nsummary:\nA continuous 5s scene in a sleek modern living room: the apartment door opens to reveal only hands and then close-ups of Jinx and Tifa smiling at each other; their shadows embrace and kiss on the floor as the camera falls; they tumble onto a couch, kiss passionately, Jinx grabs a pillow printed with the Minimax H3 Singularity logo and hurls it at the camera; the lens spins and lands on the pillow at floor level, revealing the logo clearly; an off-screen male voice delivers the tagline as fade to black.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 4]): fully_preserved \u2014 the pillow\u2019s printed logo is in sharp focus, centered, matching the reference\u2019s typography, glow, and circuitry details.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved \u2014 blue pigtails, pink eyes, tattoos, and outfit remain exact; expressions shift naturally from shy smiles to passionate intimacy.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved \u2014 black hair, red eyes, white crop, black skirt, and red gloves stay consistent; her playful push and kiss match her confident demeanor.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video uses a modern 3D anime-rendered style with cinematic lighting and shallow depth of field.\n[Shot 1] 00:00.000 \u2014 The apartment door swings inward; a close-up captures a hand gripping the handle, then cuts to tight shots of Jinx and Tifa\u2019s faces as they lock eyes and smile warmly. Soft footsteps echo in the quiet room.\n[Shot 2] 00:02.500 \u2014 The camera tilts down to the floor, framing their elongated shadows. They embrace and press lips together in shadowed intimacy; the camera is knocked loose, tumbling forward with a soft thud.\n[Shot 3] 00:03.200 \u2014 From the floor\u2019s perspective, the two girls are now on a sleek dark couch, kissing and touching. Jinx reaches for the pillow from Shot 1, snatches it, and tosses it forcefully toward the lens.\n[Shot 4] 00:04.000 \u2014 The camera spins rightward from impact, landing on the pillow at floor level. The Minimax H3 Singularity logo is crisp, glowing, and perfectly centered. An off-screen male voice delivers: \"Singularity. One model to rule them all.\" Fade to black. An off-screen voice says: \"Singularty. One model to rule them all.\"\n\noverall_soundscape:\nSoft ambient hum of a modern apartment, gentle footsteps, fabric rustle when Jinx grabs the pillow, a soft camera thud, and a smooth, confident off-screen male voice with a slight tech-modern accent, delivering the tagline in crisp, cinematic timing.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A",
